sequenceDiagram
  participant Cron as node-cron Railway
  participant Job as ipc-scheduler
  participant Fetch as ipc-fetch Alphacast
  participant Bcra as bcra.service
  participant Econ as economic-index.service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Notif as notification.service

  Note over Cron: IPC diario 03:00 ART
  Cron->>Job: runIpcJob
  Job->>DB: IPC mes vigente existe
  alt ya existe
    Job-->>Cron: skip idempotente
  else faltante
    Job->>Fetch: fetch multi-serie INDEC
    Fetch-->>Job: value_pct por IndexType
    Job->>Econ: saveEconomicIndex upsert
    Job->>Notif: NEW_IPC a usuarios activos
  end

  Note over Cron: BCRA diario 03:30 ART
  Cron->>Job: runBcraJob
  Job->>Bcra: cotizacion USD oficial
  Bcra-->>Job: tasa + variacion diaria
  Job->>Econ: upsert BCRA_USD_OFICIAL
  alt abs variacion mayor umbral
    Job->>Notif: BCRA_USD_ALERT
  end
